{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Journey Through the Undead",
    "steam_appid": 3532280,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532280/extras/f212b16a6d88f7f1bbe99ec0fb16735b.avif?t=1754889268\" data-has-big width=800 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey through a world ravaged by a failed experiment, now overrun by relentless zombies and eerie mutations. Battle through stunning environments, from abandoned cities to dark swamps, using an arsenal of weapons to fight the horrors that lurk in the shadows. This is the zombie-only version of Aftertime, our previous game, featuring remastered gameplay and improved level design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The missions follow a gripping linear path, taking you from one harrowing location to another in search of answers and safety. As a lone survivor, you have no idea what truly happened or if anyone else remains alive. The game balances moments of eerie stillness with intense, chaotic battles for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect weapons, find ammo and kill anything on your way.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532280/extras/6c893d7565526fb2b7e503121bf1439e.poster.avif?t=1754889268\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532280/extras/6c893d7565526fb2b7e503121bf1439e.webm?t=1754889268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful yet hostile locations to explore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532280/extras/1fa8d3f13d33ad7f02569b6f981b5b79.poster.avif?t=1754889268\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532280/extras/1fa8d3f13d33ad7f02569b6f981b5b79.webm?t=1754889268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw grenades and shoot explosive barrels to take down zombies in thrilling combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use health kits and food to stay fit and ready for the next fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >State-of-the-art technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in photorealistic graphics with cinema-quality models and textures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic real-time lighting for a visually stunning world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch off the HUD entirely by pressing TAB for a more immersive experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532280/extras/f212b16a6d88f7f1bbe99ec0fb16735b.avif?t=1754889268\" data-has-big width=800 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey through a world ravaged by a failed experiment, now overrun by relentless zombies and eerie mutations. Battle through stunning environments, from abandoned cities to dark swamps, using an arsenal of weapons to fight the horrors that lurk in the shadows. This is the zombie-only version of Aftertime, our previous game, featuring remastered gameplay and improved level design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The missions follow a gripping linear path, taking you from one harrowing location to another in search of answers and safety. As a lone survivor, you have no idea what truly happened or if anyone else remains alive. The game balances moments of eerie stillness with intense, chaotic battles for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect weapons, find ammo and kill anything on your way.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532280/extras/6c893d7565526fb2b7e503121bf1439e.poster.avif?t=1754889268\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532280/extras/6c893d7565526fb2b7e503121bf1439e.webm?t=1754889268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful yet hostile locations to explore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532280/extras/1fa8d3f13d33ad7f02569b6f981b5b79.poster.avif?t=1754889268\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532280/extras/1fa8d3f13d33ad7f02569b6f981b5b79.webm?t=1754889268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw grenades and shoot explosive barrels to take down zombies in thrilling combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use health kits and food to stay fit and ready for the next fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >State-of-the-art technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in photorealistic graphics with cinema-quality models and textures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic real-time lighting for a visually stunning world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch off the HUD entirely by pressing TAB for a more immersive experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Blast through hordes of relentless zombies in an action-packed journey across a stunning, mutated world. Arm yourself with guns, melee weapons, and grenades as you fight for survival through eerie ruins and deadly swamps.",
